01:41:04.956 --> 01:41:05.456
Hmm.

01:41:06.044 --> 01:41:06.544
Don't?

01:41:07.132 --> 01:41:07.692
Yeah, crow.

01:41:08.220 --> 01:41:12.300
Did you ever wonder that maybe this spaceship isn't really a spaceship at all, but...

01:41:12.476 --> 01:41:15.016
a television set built for the amusement of the viewing audience.

01:41:15.484 --> 01:41:18.364
And I'm not really a robot, but a puppet to build to look like a robot.

01:41:18.620 --> 01:41:21.820
who is in reality being controlled by a puppeteer under this very table.

01:41:22.524 --> 01:41:25.244
And you're not a scientist slash inventor trapped in outer space.

01:41:25.500 --> 01:41:28.740
but just a comedian playing a part on an television show that you wrote.

01:41:31.470 --> 01:41:33.550
No, I don't think so either, somehow.

01:41:34.100 --> 01:41:38.620
You know, Crow, one thing I always wanted to ask you is,

01:41:38.660 --> 01:41:40.360
why is it that you never foamed?

01:41:40.580 --> 01:41:43.000
Because I thought I'd save it for the end of our transmission.

01:41:43.510 --> 01:41:44.170
Oh, great idea.

01:41:47.460 --> 01:41:48.920
You serious? Golly.

01:41:48.980 --> 01:41:49.440
Eek!

01:41:49.500 --> 01:41:53.140
I guess that's it, folks. We'll see you in a year.

01:41:53.240 --> 01:41:54.720
You are sick.

01:41:55.080 --> 01:41:55.480
Goodbye.
